&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As An Active Member Of Our Team, You Will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the ultimate connector and trusted advisor, building unbreakable bridges of trust between our internal sales teams and our partners&#39; technical wizards, ensuring seamless collaboration and shared success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary technical authority for a growing portfolio of partners, empowering them with the architectural expertise and best practices needed to solve their customers&#39; most complex data challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively champion the partner-led sales motion, mentoring our partners’ SEs through live sales cycles to build their confidence, increase deal velocity, and drive a significant increase in partner-led revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transform our partners&#39; technical capabilities from subjective to factual, establishing clear metrics for success and fostering a culture of continuous learning and certification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evangelize Cribl&#39;s value pillars and use cases, coaching partners on how to build compelling business cases and articulate the unique power of our solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve the overall experience for our customers by ensuring they receive expert-level support and guidance from a highly competent, local partner network that you helped build.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the champion and driving force behind our partner technical enablement strategy in APAC: sponsoring and executing a world-class program of workshops, bootcamps, and coaching sessions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document compelling use cases in blog posts and contribute enhancements to product documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel up to 50% across ANZ and ASEAN to engage with partners and support key opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are a remote-first company and work happens across many time-zones – you may be required to occasionally perform duties outside your standard working hours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If You’ve Got It - We Want It&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are looking for a unique blend of deep technical expertise, exceptional communication skills, and a genuine passion for teaching and mentorship.&lt;/li&gt;
