&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in a partner-facing or channel-focused technical role is highly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to train, mentor, and enable technical teams. Experience developing technical training materials (workshops, labs, presentations) is a significant plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep domain expertise with Logs, Metrics, IT Operations, and Security (SIEM, SOAR, Observability Platforms).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication and presentation skills, with the ability to distill complex technical concepts for a wide range of audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, programmatic mindset with a talent for building relationships and influencing both internal and external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working remotely.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You live in &lt;strong&gt;Sydney &lt;/strong&gt;(Preferred) or Melbourne&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
