&lt;li&gt;Experience selling through a channel led motion&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to create demand in a territory and selling un-budgeted solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background using MEDDIC&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
