&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a driven Senior Technical Program Manager who puts customers first and will help deliver our challenging product development programs. This includes managing program schedules, identifying risks and clearly communicating them to program stakeholders. We are looking for people who love to get stuff done, and laugh a bit along the way. Cribl is a serious company that doesn’t take itself too seriously. You will be a key contributor to the success of the Product and Engineering teams and help grow the Technical Program Management practice at Cribl. This role reports to the Senior Manager of Technical Program Management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;As An Active Member Of Our Team, You Will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide leadership for development initiatives and lead the end to end delivery of complex initiatives across multiple teams, ensuring successful outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support your teams through the pivots needed to address shifts in business trends and priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply Technical Program Management best practices and contribute to improving software development processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use technical skills and domain knowledge to help align teams around a shared plan and direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and report on metrics for quality and performance across your programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain ongoing communication of planning, program status, issues, and risks to stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;If You’ve Got It - We Want It&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
