&lt;li&gt;3+ years of leadership experience on software teams as a Technical Program Manager or Development Manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering complex projects or solutions that span multiple teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written skills coupled with an ability to present to all levels in an organization, whether explaining your team&#39;s analyses and recommendations to leadership or discussing the technical trade-offs in product development with engineers&lt;/li&gt;
