&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;In this role, you will be joining a highly technical and collaborative team that is committed to shipping high quality software and enjoying all the goat gifs the internet has to offer. The ideal candidate for this role has a mixture of strong technical chops, an innate desire to help customers, and a natural affinity for collaboration.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
